{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41191","headline":"登楼望月二首 二 · 刘斌","name":"登楼望月二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎洁三秋月，巍峨百丈楼。\n下分征客路，上有美人愁。\n帐卷芙蓉带，帘褰玳瑁钩。\n倚窗情渺渺，凭槛思悠悠。\n末得金波转，俄成玉筯流。\n不堪三五夕，夫壻在边州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}